  "next-page": "Pagina successiva",
  "previous-page": "Pagina precedenta",
  "heading-notes": "Note",
  "globalSearch-instructions-heading": "Instrucziuns per tschertgar",
  "globalSearch-instructions-description": "Tschertgas pon cuntegnair operaturs per precisar la tschertga. Ils operaturs vegnan inditgads cun scriver lur num e valur separads cun in punct dubel. Per exempel limitescha `list:Blocked` la tschertga a cartas en ina glista numnada *Blocked*. Sche la valur cuntegna spazis u caracters spezials, sto ella vegnir messa tranter virgulettas (p.ex. `__operator_list__:\"To Review\"`).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operators": "Operaturs disponibels:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-board": "`__operator_board__:<title>` - cartas en tabellas che correspundan al *<title>* inditgà",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-list": "`__operator_list__:<title>` - cartas en glistas che correspundan al *<title>* inditgà",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-swimlane": "`__operator_swimlane__:<title>` - cartas en swimlanes che correspundan al *<title>* inditgà",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-comment": "`__operator_comment__:<text>` - cartas cun in commentari che cuntegna *<text>*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-label": "`__operator_label__:<color>` `__operator_label__:<name>` - cartas cun in’etichetta che correspunda a *<color>* u *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-hash": "`__operator_label_abbrev__<name|color>` - abreviaziun per `__operator_label__:<color>` u `__operator_label__:<name>`",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-user": "`__operator_user__:<username>` - cartas nua che *<username>* è in *commember* u ina *persuna responsabla*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-at": "`__operator_user_abbrev__username` - abbreviazion per `user:<username>`",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-member": "`__operator_member__:<username>` - cartas nua che *<username>* è in *commember*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-assignee": "`__operator_assignee__:<username>` - cartas nua che *<username>* è ina *persuna responsabla*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-creator": "`__operator_creator__:<username>` - cartas nua che *<username>* è il creatur da la carta",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-org": "`__operator_org__:<display name|short name>` - cartas d’ina tabella attribuida a l’organisaziun *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-team": "`__operator_team__:<display name|short name>` - cartas d’ina tabella attribuida a la squadra *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-due": "`__operator_due__:<n>` - cartas cun scadenza entaifer *<n>* dis a partir dad ussa. `__operator_due__:__predicate_overdue__ enumerescha tut las cartas cun data da scadenza passada.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-created": "`__operator_created__:<n>` - cartas ch’èn vegnidas creadas avant *<n>* dis u pli pauc",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-modified": "`__operator_modified__:<n>` - cartas ch’èn vegnidas modifitgadas avant *<n>* dis u pli pauc",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-status": "`__operator_status__:<status>` - nua che *<status>* è ina da las suandantas valurs:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-archived": "`__predicate_archived__` - cartas archivadas",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-all": "`__predicate_all__` - tut las cartas archivadas e betg archivadas",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-ended": "`__predicate_ended__` - cartas cun ina data da fin",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-public": "`__predicate_public__` - cartas mo en tabellas publicas",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-private": "`__predicate_private__` - cartas mo en tabellas privatas",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-has": "`__operator_has__:<field>` - nua che *<field>* è in da `__predicate_attachment__`, `__predicate_checklist__`, `__predicate_description__`, `__predicate_start__`, `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_end__`, `__predicate_assignee__` u `__predicate_member__`. Metter in `-` avant *<field>* tschertga l’absenza d’ina valur en quel champ (p.ex. `has:-due` tschertga cartas senza data da scadenza).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-sort": "`__operator_sort__:<sort-name>` - dove *<sort-name>* ie uno di `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_created__` o `__predicate_modified__`.  Per un ordine discendente, agiuntar un `-` dinant al num.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-limit": "`__operator_limit__:<n>` - nua che *<n>* è in dumber entir positiv che inditgescha il dumber da cartas da mussar per pagina.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-1": "I pon vegnir inditgads plirs operaturs.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-2": "Operaturs sumegliants vegnan cumbinads cun *OR*. Cartas che correspundan ad almain ina da las cundiziuns vegnan returnadas.\n`__operator_list__:Available __operator_list__:Blocked` returnass cartas en mintga glista numnada *Blocked* u *Available*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3": "Operaturs differents vegnan cumbinads cun *AND*. Mo cartas che correspundan a tut ils operaturs differents vegnan returnadas. `__operator_list__:Available __operator_label__:red` returna mo cartas en la glista *Available* cun in’etichetta *red*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3-2": "Ils dis pon vegnir inditgads sco dumber entir positiv u negativ u cun `__predicate_week__`, `__predicate_month__`, `__predicate_quarter__` u `__predicate_year__` per la perioda actuala.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-4": "Tschertgas da text na distinguan betg tranter maiusclas e minusclas.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-5": "Sco standard na vegnan cartas archivadas betg tschertgadas.",
